# Flow Supabase Safety

## Allowed project

```text
zuvtnmmnwohrapaecsuj
```

Never access the retired apptech project. Never expose secrets or service-role keys in browser code.

## Migration discipline

Before applying any migration:

```bash
npx supabase@2.116.0 migration list --linked
npx supabase@2.116.0 db push --dry-run
```

- Confirm linked project is `zuvtnmmnwohrapaecsuj`
- Dry-run must show only intended migration(s)
- Never reset, repair, or destructively modify migration history
- Additive migrations only; no destructive alteration of prior migrations

## New tenant tables

- RLS enabled on every table
- `workspace_id` on tenant-owned records
- Permission-aware policies
- Cross-tenant denial verified
- Indexes on foreign keys and common list queries

## Financial data

All monetary values: `bigint` minor units + ISO 4217 currency. Percentages: integer basis points. Durations: integer minutes.
